    "summary": "A built-to-suit (BTS) warehouse is built by a developer to one tenant's specification on a long pre-committed lease, typically about 10 years with a 5 to 6 year lock-in. End to end it takes roughly 12 to 20 months. It suits large occupiers with a planned ramp-up and a spec no ready building meets without costly rework.",
