        "kind": "p",
        "text": "Take a year-one rent of Rs 21 per sq ft per month escalating at 5% a year, which is the common structure. By year ten it is Rs 32.6, and the average across the full ten-year term is Rs 26.4. So a flat BTS quote of about Rs 26 and an escalating market quote starting at Rs 21 are, in cash terms, close to the same deal. A flat quote that looks 25% expensive on day one is usually just the same rent expressed differently."
